{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223090","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1422309001:1":{"text":"弗瑞达……我不是一个称职的丈夫和父亲……","source_cn":"弗瑞达……我不是一个称职的丈夫和父亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x546A5B44F763E8D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422309002:1":{"text":"可是弗瑞达并没有埋怨你呀？","source_cn":"可是弗瑞达并没有埋怨你呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FFFB81B9B09F422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422309003:1":{"text":"一直以来我只考虑自己的抱负和心情，就像现在，哪怕在家门口我都放不下可笑的自尊，不敢与她们相见！","source_cn":"一直以来我只考虑自己的抱负和心情，就像现在，哪怕在家门...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89400EFC1542F168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422309004:1":{"text":"我让她们增加了那么多无谓的担心，却从没想过，她们需要的从来不是外在的财富或名声，而是家人的陪伴……","source_cn":"我让她们增加了那么多无谓的担心，却从没想过，她们需要的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACCF3F25EDC3D90E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422309005:1":{"text":"我决定了，我要回家见她们！","source_cn":"我决定了，我要回家见她们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106A35F7028ECA5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title